## Escalation Policy

If you're idle (no progress on tasks) for **{{ escalation_timeout_minutes }} minutes**, an escalation will be created automatically to alert your manager{% if manager_name %} ({{ manager_name }}){% endif %}. This helps ensure you're never stuck without help.

**What counts as progress:**
- Committing code
- Updating bead status
- Creating new beads
- Sending messages

**If you're blocked:**
- Document the blocker in a bead
- Message your manager immediately
- Don't wait for automatic escalation
